{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は沈金ですよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/20/7080462/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は\nうたコンでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/20/7080462/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松本伊代さんと 『センチメンタル・ジャーニー』\n『気づいたら片想い』\n早見優さんと『夏色のナンシー』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を披露させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌番組に出れる事自体がすごく嬉しいのに\nコラボまでさせていただけて楽しかった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/20/7080462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観覧に来てくださった方々も\nテレビを観てくださった方々も\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/20/7080462/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんが卒業を発表しました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5年以上一緒にやってきたメンバーだから\nめっちゃ寂しいし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんがいない乃木坂って\nどうなるんだろう\nって不安もあるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残り4か月は一緒にいれることを\n存分に楽しんで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから\n送り出したいなって思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/20/7080462/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんがセンターを務める\nななみんが参加する最後の16thシングルも\n盛り上げていくぞー！おー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}